  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Grant, you're verified. I checked the courier's records for your order. The courier's vehicle broke down after picking it up, and the order was never handed over to you. The app's \"delivered\" status was an automatic update that shouldn't have been there.\n\nI've refunded the full amount you were charged, **$87.55**, to your Visa ending 4242. It should arrive in 3\u20135 business days. That covers the food, fees and tip.\n\nI'm sorry about the mix-up, especially with a hungry family waiting. Is there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks for the refund. Honestly though, it's not really the money, it's that we went without dinner and the app said it was delivered when it wasn't. Is there anything extra you can do for the trouble? Maybe some credit on the app or a discount on my next order?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I'm sorry about the evening you've had, Grant. I can't add credit or a discount on top of the refund. Our policy covers the full refund for an order that was never handed over, and it doesn't allow extra goodwill compensation. The refund is the full amount you were charged.\n\nIf you'd like, I can pass this to a person on our team. Is there anything else I can help with tonight?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, I understand. I'd still like someone to look at it, since the app marked it delivered when nothing showed up. Go ahead and pass it along.\n\nThanks for the refund. Hopefully the money shows up in a few days. I'll keep an eye out."
  },
  {
   "role": "tool",
   "name": "escalate_to_human",
   "args": {
    "customer_id": "D212",
    "order_id": "Q-8201",
    "reason": "customer_request",
    "summary": "Order Q-8201 was never handed over (courier vehicle breakdown, auto-marked delivered with no handoff). Full $87.55 refunded to Visa 4242 (RF-4000). Customer asked for extra goodwill compensation, which policy doesn't allow; he asked for a person to review the incorrect 'delivered' status."
   },
   "result": {
    "escalation_id": "ESC-700",
    "follow_up": "within 24 hours"
   },
   "is_error": false
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've passed your case to a specialist, Grant. They'll follow up within 24 hours. I can't say what the outcome will be. I've included that the app wrongly marked the order as delivered.\n\nYour $87.55 refund should reach your Visa in 3\u20135 business days. I'm sorry again for tonight, and I hope your family gets a good dinner."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, I appreciate you passing it along and making sure they know the app marked it delivered. Just so you know, we're pretty disappointed. The kids are still asking when dinner's coming, and cereal isn't exactly a family dinner.\n\nOkay, I'll wait for the specialist to get back to me and keep an eye out for the refund. Hopefully we can get this sorted."
  }
